## Authentication

Only an authenticated recruiter should be allowed to
create an internship.

The servlet checks:

session.getAttribute("userId")

If the session does not contain a valid user ID, the
recruiter is redirected to the login page.

---

## Validation

The following fields are required:

- Internship title
- Description
- Duration

Other fields may be optional depending on the database
schema and project requirements.

---

## Internship Information

### Title

The name of the internship position.

Example:

Java Developer Intern

### Description

Contains information about the internship role and
responsibilities.

### Location

Specifies where the internship is conducted.

Example:

Jaipur

or

Remote

### Duration

Specifies the length of the internship.

Example:

3 Months

### Stipend

Specifies the stipend offered by the company.

### Eligibility

Specifies the student qualifications required.

Example:

B.Tech IT / CSE

### Deadline

Specifies the last date for applications.

