## Testing

### Test 1 - Login Protection

Open the internship page without logging in.

Expected:

The user is redirected to the login page.

### Test 2 - Empty Title

Submit the form without an internship title.

Expected:

"Internship title is required."

### Test 3 - Empty Description

Submit the form without a description.

Expected:

"Internship description is required."

### Test 4 - Empty Duration

Submit the form without duration.

Expected:

"Internship duration is required."

### Test 5 - Valid Internship

Enter all required information and submit.

Expected:

Internship posting is successfully processed.

